<div id="2026-09-03-api-todo-create-optional-columns" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-09-03 — api_todo_create now honours reporter / owner / is_blocking at create time</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>The bug.</strong> <code>POST /api/todo/create</code> built its INSERT from a fixed key list, so any other column in the JSON was <b>silently dropped</b>. Passing <code>reporter</code>, <code>owner</code>, or <code>is_blocking</code> returned <code>success: 1</code> while storing nothing — callers had to create-then-update as a workaround. Found while filing the cross-branch time todos: todo #2390 came back with an empty reporter even though the field was sent.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Fix.</strong> The handler now assembles a <code>%create</code> hash then copies through any column present in a whitelist of real <code>Todo</code> columns: <code>reporter owner is_blocking blocked_by_todo_id parent_id sort_order todo_type billable estimated_man_hours comments company_code time_of_day scheduled_date scheduled_start scheduled_end plan_id point_rate role_category is_fixed is_recurring</code>. Non-whitelisted keys are rejected (verified: <code>bogus_column</code> is dropped), and anything not supplied keeps its previous default. Endpoint POD updated with the list.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why is_blocking matters.</strong> <code>Util::TodoRanking::score_todo</code> dampens a priority-1 todo to 5 unless <code>_looks_like_real_blocker()</code> matches — which needs <code>is_blocking=1</code> or outage keywords. So a P1 created without it never surfaces in the Focus Queue. Anyone scripting urgent todos must set it (now possible in one call).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Verification.</strong> Logic isolated in <code>/tmp/simulate_create.pl</code>: 6/6 assertions pass (reporter, owner, is_blocking honoured; bogus rejected; defaults preserved; developer fallback). <b>Not yet verified end-to-end</b> — the :4003 worker had not reloaded <code>Api.pm</code> during testing (probe todos #2391&ndash;#2393 stored empty values), and per the no-restart rule the server was not bounced. Probe todos cancelled. <b>Re-test after the next natural reload.</b></p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/Api.pm</code> (<code>api_todo_create</code>, ~line 540 + POD ~line 421).</p>
</div>
